SUMMARY:PICTURE BOOKS ARE NOT JUST FOR LITTLE CHILDREN!
DESCRIPTION:with Jane Godwin In this stimulating and interactive session\, 
 we’ll explore picture books from every angle and the many opportunities 
 they bring to a classroom or family story time - whether with 5-year-olds 
 or 15-year-olds. Drawing on her experience as both publisher and writer\, 
 and using examples from picture books around the world\, Jane explores the
  power of this art form to enlighten\, entertain\, inspire and educate.
LOCATION:LSODE Campus
URL:https://storyfest.com.au/
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
